  url: https://roundoperations.gitcoin.co/round-operations/round-setup/setup-on-grants-stack
  link_status: active
  is_source_system_candidate: false
  notes: >-
    Gitcoin's open tooling for running a QF round end to end (create a
    program, choose Quadratic Funding, set round basics, payout token and
    matching pool, optional matching cap/minimum donation/Human Passport
    requirement, eligibility rules, then launch on-chain). The article frames
    the hard part as everything around the software — raising a real
    matching pool, recruiting genuine projects, and driving real donor
    turnout in a short window.
